WEBVTT

00:32.960 --> 00:35.040
All of us have heard countless apologies

00:36.080 --> 00:39.040
in this beautiful world.

00:41.920 --> 00:43.120
If we make a mistake,

00:44.720 --> 00:46.080
we apologize.

00:48.960 --> 00:50.520
And yet, we still make more mistakes.

00:53.960 --> 00:55.000
Perhaps

00:55.760 --> 01:00.200
our apology is actually meant
for our next mistake.

02:46.160 --> 02:47.360
Hey, guys.

02:49.440 --> 02:51.720
Where were you?
You skipped practice again.

02:53.400 --> 02:55.600
There is a new girl. She's in classroom B.

02:56.160 --> 02:57.840
-Classroom B?
-Is she pretty?

03:05.040 --> 03:07.080
Would I be telling you about her
if she wasn't pretty?

03:08.640 --> 03:10.720
-Let's go.
-Let's go. What are we waiting for?

03:17.960 --> 03:19.040
Where?

03:19.120 --> 03:20.680
-Which one?
-That one.

03:22.960 --> 03:24.680
She's my type.

03:24.760 --> 03:25.760
She's exactly my type.

03:25.840 --> 03:27.240
What about Nan?

03:28.120 --> 03:30.280
No one else matters anymore.

03:30.960 --> 03:32.360
But I found out her name first.

03:32.440 --> 03:33.600
She must be mine then.

03:33.680 --> 03:34.920
-What the heck?
-What's her name?

03:35.000 --> 03:36.760
I'm not telling you.

03:38.520 --> 03:40.800
Guys, she looked at me just now.

03:40.880 --> 03:43.120
No, she looked at me.

03:43.200 --> 03:45.840
You guys are wrong.
She smiled at me just now.

03:46.640 --> 03:48.440
Are you sure?

03:52.040 --> 03:54.000
I told you to practice
for the competition.

03:54.320 --> 03:56.840
What are you doing here?
Are you already good enough?

03:56.920 --> 03:58.960
Aren't you being unfair
to your hardworking teammates?

03:59.040 --> 04:00.680
-They are--
-What's all this loud noise?

04:01.240 --> 04:02.360
Well...

04:02.440 --> 04:04.520
They skipped
their basketball practice, ma'am.

04:04.960 --> 04:06.560
I'm sorry for being so loud.

04:06.640 --> 04:07.880
I see.

04:09.040 --> 04:10.680
Let's go. Hurry.

04:10.760 --> 04:12.920
Everyone, let's continue.

04:13.000 --> 04:15.160
I was talking about...

04:15.240 --> 04:17.800
I-Tim, who were those three guys?

04:18.519 --> 04:19.720
They are "The Three Points."

04:20.279 --> 04:21.920
They are our school's basketball players.

04:22.000 --> 04:23.400
They are funny.

04:23.480 --> 04:26.080
They are troublemakers.
Don't pay attention to them, Nanno.

04:29.440 --> 04:30.760
Do you like them, I-Tim?

04:33.040 --> 04:34.360
They are handsome,

04:35.480 --> 04:37.480
but they already have so many fans.

04:38.120 --> 04:39.880
I can't compete with all their fans.

05:01.720 --> 05:03.800
Keep running until I get tired.

05:04.440 --> 05:05.320
Good.

05:08.920 --> 05:10.400
Why did you skip practice?

05:11.080 --> 05:12.320
To check out a girl.

05:12.400 --> 05:13.400
Great.

05:16.000 --> 05:18.000
-Is she pretty?
-Yes, she is.

05:19.760 --> 05:21.880
Hok, were you the one
who led your friends there?

05:21.960 --> 05:23.280
I'm sorry, Coach.

05:23.360 --> 05:24.280
Don't apologize.

05:25.520 --> 05:26.560
I asked you a question.

05:26.640 --> 05:28.400
Were you the one
who led your friends there?

05:28.520 --> 05:29.520
Yes, Coach.

05:31.160 --> 05:32.080
That's just great.

05:33.200 --> 05:34.240
Faster!

05:34.320 --> 05:35.840
The Hainanese chicken rice was so good.

05:35.960 --> 05:36.800
Come on!

05:37.280 --> 05:38.280
I'm not tired yet.

05:42.840 --> 05:43.680
Faster.

05:45.640 --> 05:47.120
Have you found out her name?

05:48.280 --> 05:49.280
It's Nanno.

05:53.960 --> 05:58.320
WHO IS THIS NANNO?

05:58.400 --> 06:01.960
THE NEW GIRL IN 11TH GRADE, CLASSROOM B.

06:02.040 --> 06:06.400
SHE'S CUTE.

06:06.480 --> 06:10.040
YOU CAN ALREADY TELL SHE'S BITCHY
JUST BY HER NAME.

06:10.120 --> 06:12.400
SHE MOVED HERE
IN THE MIDDLE OF THE SEMESTER.

06:12.480 --> 06:14.520
SHE MUST BE TROUBLED.

06:14.600 --> 06:19.040
DID SHE GET EXPELLED FROM HER OLD SCHOOL?

06:19.120 --> 06:23.680
CAN HER SKIRT BE ANY SHORTER THAN THAT?

06:23.760 --> 06:26.720
SHE'S SO SEXY.

06:26.800 --> 06:29.800
I WILL BE A GOOD BOY
ONCE I GET TO HAVE SEX WITH HER.

06:29.880 --> 06:32.320
WHICH RHINOPLASTY SURGEON DID SHE GO TO?

06:32.400 --> 06:35.200
