12:13.440 --> 12:18.600
SHE SAYS SHE DOESN'T LIKE HIM,
YET SHE STILL FLIRTS WITH HIM.

12:26.440 --> 12:28.760
SHE SAYS SHE DOESN'T LIKE HIM,
YET SHE STILL FLIRTS WITH HIM.

12:28.880 --> 12:30.640
