13:22.320 --> 13:24.000
No, it's fine. We'll wait for you.

13:24.320 --> 13:25.280
Okay.

13:26.280 --> 13:28.000
-Hurry up.
-Okay.

13:28.080 --> 13:31.800
All you do is play basketball.
How will that make you smarter?

13:32.200 --> 13:33.200
