13:49.240 --> 13:51.640
If you can do this,
then you will know the method.

13:51.720 --> 13:53.920
You want to divide by 1,000 people, right?

13:54.000 --> 13:55.960
Try to use this formula.

13:56.040 --> 14:00.600
It will be 3x multiply by 3y plus 32.

14:00.680 --> 14:02.480
