15:52.760 --> 15:55.320
He has a bad personality and he's stupid.

16:06.360 --> 16:09.960
He's not stupid.
He's just not good at studying.

16:16.440 --> 16:19.920
I don't know why I love him.

16:30.320 --> 16:31.480
