-Great!

19:41.520 --> 19:42.560
Bottoms up.

19:43.400 --> 19:49.000
-Bottoms up.
-Bottoms up.

19:50.360 --> 19:52.120
-Bottoms up.
-Bottoms up.

19:52.200 --> 19:54.080
