-Bottoms up.

19:54.560 --> 19:55.480
-Yes.
-Yes

19:55.560 --> 19:58.840
-Bottoms up.
-Bottoms up.

19:58.920 --> 20:01.760
-Bottoms up.
-Bottoms up.

20:01.840 --> 20:02.760
-Bottoms...
-Bottoms...

20:15.960 --> 20:17.240
