20:33.480 --> 20:34.880
This is my house.

20:35.840 --> 20:37.880
-I will go first.
-Fine.

20:37.960 --> 20:39.320
-Hurry up.
-Yes.

20:39.400 --> 20:41.280
-Yes.
-Can you carry her?

20:41.960 --> 20:43.320
-Go.
-Okay.

20:43.400 --> 20:44.440
-How do I do this?
-Oh, god.

21:07.680 --> 21:08.880
-Aren't you going to ask?
-Fuck.

21:15.760 --> 21:17.280
I'm sorry.

21:18.040 --> 21:19.480
I didn't mean to do it.

21:21.760 --> 21:23.400
I don't want an apology.

21:24.080 --> 21:25.640
