27:01.360 --> 27:03.440
Take this pile.

27:17.240 --> 27:18.640
Shit. Help her!

27:18.720 --> 27:21.040
Help her? Do you want to get arrested?

27:21.120 --> 27:22.880
What are we waiting for? Help her!

27:23.440 --> 27:25.840
You will get arrested if you help her.

27:25.920 --> 27:27.000
What should we do?

27:27.080 --> 27:29.080
-Kill her!
-Kill her yourself!

27:29.160 --> 27:30.200
You coward!

27:33.160 --> 27:34.880
Are you going to wait for her to get up?

27:37.280 --> 27:38.640
Fuck. Hurry up.

27:56.880 --> 27:58.360
Dig over there!

27:59.920 --> 28:01.080
Hurry up, Hok.

28:20.920 --> 28:22.160
I'm sorry, Nanno.

28:23.800 --> 28:24.960
Please forgive me.

28:30.200 --> 28:31.520
I'm sorry, Nanno.

28:34.000 --> 28:35.080
I'm sorry.

28:36.640 --> 28:38.040
I didn't mean to do it.

28:39.640 --> 28:40.800
I'm sorry.

28:47.560 --> 28:48.640
I'm sorry.

29:36.560 --> 29:37.720
I'm sorry.

29:42.000 --> 29:43.080
Come in.

29:45.760 --> 29:47.240
Get your books out, everyone.

29:58.120 --> 29:59.320
Taew, I-Tim.

29:59.400 --> 30:00.920
Weren't you going to wake me up at all?

30:29.280 --> 30:31.160
Do you think she knows about last night?

30:31.240 --> 30:32.600
I don't know.

30:32.680 --> 30:33.560
Oh, no.

30:36.360 --> 30:37.440
Do you want some?

30:39.600 --> 30:41.520
You look so pale.

30:42.400 --> 30:44.240
We probably got really drunk last night.

30:48.920 --> 30:50.160
Who are you?

30:51.480 --> 30:53.000
Did you forget me already, Taew?

30:53.800 --> 30:54.920
I'm Nanno.

30:56.520 --> 30:58.240
Do you have Alzheimer's?

31:03.000 --> 31:04.520
You are not Nanno.

31:06.320 --> 31:07.640
If I'm not Nanno,

31:08.800 --> 31:09.920
then who am I?

31:13.360 --> 31:15.000
Are you Nanno's twin?

31:15.520 --> 31:16.800
That's crazy.

31:17.640 --> 31:18.800
I-Tim.

31:18.880 --> 31:20.200
How did you come up with that?

31:20.920 --> 31:21.800
Guys.

31:22.680 --> 31:24.640
Both of you

31:25.120 --> 31:26.760
look sick today.

31:26.960 --> 31:28.320
Let me give you a checkup.

31:33.840 --> 31:35.600
Your pulse is strong.

31:41.840 --> 31:43.520
Your temperature is fine, too.

31:44.880 --> 31:46.560
You guys are probably not sick.

31:47.880 --> 31:48.840
And...

31:50.160 --> 31:51.480
this wound on your hand

31:52.480 --> 31:53.800
is so ugly.

31:54.880 --> 31:56.400
It looks like you did some digging.

31:58.280 --> 31:59.200
Listen.

31:59.840 --> 32:01.680
The party last night was so fun.

32:02.240 --> 32:05.640
Don't forget to invite me next time.

32:16.480 --> 32:17.680
So this means

32:17.760 --> 32:19.040
that she didn't disappear.

32:20.120 --> 32:21.240
Are we out of trouble now?

32:21.320 --> 32:22.640
Are you crazy?

32:23.320 --> 32:26.040
Do you think this girl posing as Nanno
has no objectives?

32:26.600 --> 32:29.200
What do you want us to do?
Kill another person?

32:30.120 --> 32:31.840
You should think before you ask anything.

32:32.280 --> 32:33.760
She knows all of us.

32:33.840 --> 32:36.320
She knows this place.
She knows about the party last night.

32:36.760 --> 32:39.160
And she even knows that we were digging.

32:39.240 --> 32:41.840
And she said
that she wanted to party here again.

32:46.000 --> 32:47.160
Is it her twin?

32:48.000 --> 32:49.560
She said she was Nanno.

32:51.440 --> 32:53.120
I don't want to be involved
in this anymore.

32:54.280 --> 32:55.880
If you want to kill one more person,

32:56.640 --> 32:57.840
then go ahead.

33:01.560 --> 33:03.160
Isn't your father a teacher?

33:05.920 --> 33:08.240
-Stop.
-Don't get my father involved in this.

33:09.400 --> 33:11.160
I don't want to.

33:11.920 --> 33:14.320
But if anyone finds out,
you're going down.

33:14.400 --> 33:15.800
Your father will go down with you.

33:36.800 --> 33:37.760
What are you doing here?

33:39.160 --> 33:41.160
Don't sound so distant like that.

33:41.240 --> 33:42.480
Did you forget about last night?

33:44.880 --> 33:46.160
Hello.

33:46.760 --> 33:48.240
Everyone is here

33:48.960 --> 33:50.440
but you didn't invite me.

33:51.160 --> 33:52.400
You guys are mean.

33:59.280 --> 34:01.760
I'm kidding. I just forgot my phone.

34:04.680 --> 34:05.920
It's probably in Hok's bedroom.

34:07.280 --> 34:08.199
Fuck.

34:32.639 --> 34:33.960
The bed is so soft.

34:35.159 --> 34:38.239
It's too bad I only spent
a short time on it.

34:43.199 --> 34:44.120
Do you want to join me?

34:46.040 --> 34:47.880
Let's relive some history.

34:52.360 --> 34:53.960
Don't you love me anymore?

34:56.040 --> 34:57.680
Were you going to dump me after?

35:06.560 --> 35:07.560
I found it.

35:14.680 --> 35:16.080
There are some great videos here.

35:16.920 --> 35:18.480
Do you want to watch them with me?

35:21.560 --> 35:22.600
Never mind.

35:23.200 --> 35:24.680
I'll watch them alone.

35:26.960 --> 35:30.000
Can I have sex with you?

35:30.480 --> 35:32.520
I love you.

35:38.520 --> 35:39.400
Taew.

35:40.000 --> 35:41.800
Are you that mad at me

35:42.440 --> 35:43.840
that you won't let me out?

35:43.920 --> 35:47.320
You can only come out
after they're done having sex with you.

35:51.360 --> 35:53.920
Hok, hurry and do what you need to do.

35:55.960 --> 35:57.240
Hok.

35:57.320 --> 36:00.120
Let me go first if you're not hard yet.

36:01.640 --> 36:02.920
I haven't done anything.

36:03.840 --> 36:05.160
Weren't you lining up?

36:07.360 --> 36:08.360
What...

36:08.960 --> 36:10.520
What should we do?

36:15.080 --> 36:16.320
We need to bury her body.

36:25.920 --> 36:28.920
It's such a shame that that is all I have.

36:31.520 --> 36:33.280
Great videos like these

36:34.880 --> 36:35.840
should be shared, right?

36:39.000 --> 36:41.400
-No!
-Don't do that!

36:43.480 --> 36:44.720
What should we do?

36:46.880 --> 36:49.920
-We're here.
-Hurry.

37:04.920 --> 37:06.080
I'm sorry, Nanno.

37:07.800 --> 37:08.680
Please forgive me.

37:10.920 --> 37:11.960
I'm sorry, Nanno.

37:17.960 --> 37:19.120
Please forgive me.

37:19.200 --> 37:20.320
Is it there?

37:20.400 --> 37:21.640
-Find it. Be careful.
-I'm sorry.

37:37.800 --> 37:38.680
That's enough!

37:43.920 --> 37:45.040
Are you guys tired?

37:50.440 --> 37:51.840
Actually, I think

37:52.800 --> 37:54.960
we should celebrate your success

37:55.640 --> 37:56.840
so you'll stop feeling tired.

38:00.840 --> 38:03.400
Take this! And this!

38:03.480 --> 38:05.520
Today has been so fun, guys.

38:07.880 --> 38:09.360
What the fuck is she?

38:09.920 --> 38:11.160
Nanno is Nanno.

38:11.440 --> 38:12.320
I told you before,

38:12.400 --> 38:13.680
-but you wouldn't listen.
-Fuck.

38:22.200 --> 38:23.840
I'm new at school.

38:24.600 --> 38:26.400
I want to know you guys better.

38:28.640 --> 38:30.080
Please be my friends.

38:30.160 --> 38:31.480
Fuck.

38:31.960 --> 38:33.760
Hurry up.

38:33.840 --> 38:34.720
Here.

38:44.400 --> 38:45.400
I'm sorry.

38:46.280 --> 38:47.520
You're sorry again?

38:52.560 --> 38:54.200
Get home safely.

38:54.280 --> 38:55.840
I'll see you tomorrow,

38:57.520 --> 38:58.560
handsome.

39:14.600 --> 39:16.760
In this beautiful world,

39:17.480 --> 39:19.680
everyone apologizes

39:20.400 --> 39:22.560
as if it's some kind of tradition.

39:22.960 --> 39:24.760
Could you please pass me the ball?

39:25.720 --> 39:26.920
If we make a mistake,

39:27.840 --> 39:29.160
we apologize.

39:29.560 --> 39:31.160
And even if we make the same mistake,

39:31.840 --> 39:33.320
we still apologize.

39:59.480 --> 40:00.720
Hello, everyone.

40:03.400 --> 40:04.600
This is humanity.

41:16.800 --> 41:18.840
Subtitle translation by
Pet-chompoo Sa-ngarmangkang
